---
description: Keep UI screens thin — split sections; prefer shared components
globs: apps/web/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# UI file structure

- Screen/container: thin — routing, data hooks, composition (`apps/web/src/screens/*`).
- Shared UI: prefer `apps/web/src/components/*` before inventing a one-off.
- Do not rebuild My tasks, List, Board, Task drawer or Quick add from scratch.
